## 💻 Local Development

### Prerequisites

Install:

- Git
- Python 3.13+
- Docker
- kubectl
- Minikube
- Jenkins
- Helm

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/kunal9038/devops-cloud-platform.git
cd devops-cloud-platform
```

---

## 🧪 Run Backend Tests

From the backend directory:

```bash
cd backend
pip install -r requirements.txt
pytest
```

Expected result:

```text
2 passed
```

---

## 🐳 Build Docker Images Manually

From the project root:

```bash
docker build -t devops-cloud-backend:local ./backend
```

```bash
docker build -t devops-cloud-frontend:local ./frontend
```

