## 🧠 What This Project Demonstrates

The most important part of this project is not simply running a Flask application.

It demonstrates an automated delivery pipeline:

```text
Code Change
    ↓
Git Commit
    ↓
Jenkins
    ↓
Automated Tests
    ↓
Docker Build
    ↓
Git SHA Image
    ↓
Docker Hub
    ↓
Kubernetes Deployment
    ↓
Rolling Update
    ↓
Ingress + HTTPS
    ↓
Monitoring
```

A successful pipeline means a developer can make a code change and have the resulting version automatically tested, containerized, published, and deployed.

